<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Avatar year net profit halves.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Avatar year net profit halves.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    17.14 vs 15.44</p>
<p>    Net					4.87 vs 9.72</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     2.00 vs nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     2.00 vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  161.60 vs 96.14</p>
<p>    Other income			   3.48 vs 5.07</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.63 vs 18.30</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		  gain 2.31 vs gain 22.16</p>
<p>Dividend is 100 percent franked  </p>
<p>Pay date Dec 18</p>
<p>Reg date Dec 4</p>
<p>    Tax					6.67 vs 5.72</p>
<p>    Interest				 4.50 vs 2.72</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   3.30 vs 2.34</p>
<p>    Minorities			     7.92 vs 22.15</p>
<p>NOTE: Avatar Industries Ltd is a diversified manufacturer and investor and is a 38 percent major shareholder of Kalamazoo Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>--  Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
